{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDepth3DimensionSynthesis","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDepth3DimensionSynthesis","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Infra.BorelRank","lean:module:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDepth3DimensionSynthesis.dimensionSynthesisHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDepth3DimensionSynthesis.dimensionSynthesisHolds","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CyclotomicDepth3DimensionSynthesis.lean#L24-L37","doc":"The depth-3 dimension-synthesis claim\n(`prop:cyclotomic-depth3-dimension-synthesis`), as a **predicate** on the\nactual dimension: the dimension of genuinely-new depth-3 content over\n`ℚ(ζ_K)` (prime `K ≥ 5`) equals the predicted `(K-3)/2`.\n\nNamed (§3b), not asserted: the previous\n`dimension_synthesis_upper_bound (K) (_ : 5 ≤ K) (_ : Prime K) :\npredictedDim K = (K-3)/2 := rfl` unfolded the definition under two unused\nhypotheses and asserted nothing (its own docstring read \"agrees with\nitself\"). The keystone-B1 upper bound is real and the lower bound is\nBeilinson-conditional — both upstream/open — so this names the claim\n(mirroring the `rank_witness` predicate fix in `QOU.Infra.BorelRank`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDepth3DimensionSynthesis.predictedDim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDepth3DimensionSynthesis.predictedDim","kind":"def","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CyclotomicDepth3DimensionSynthesis.lean#L20-L22","doc":"Predicted dimension of genuinely-new depth-3 content over\n`ℚ(ζ_K)` for prime `K ≥ 5`: `(K - 3) / 2`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}